<h1>Book a gig</h1>

<p class="lede">Originally from New Zealand, Cicada played their first Montreal show with us at our poetry punk matinee. Sanhauá en Duo played their live debut at our folklore and jazz event. Next could be you. Tell us about your music. We work with musicians at all stages of their career.</p>

<h2>What to send</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Your name</li>
  <li>A link to your music</li>
  <li>Your contact email</li>
</ul>

<p>We listen to everything we get and write back when we have a bill that fits your sound.</p>

